// The power allocator at the bottom left, while playing (the panels hide while paused), in a
// 640x360 window: the levels 1, 2 and 4 (seven bars, so the readout says FREE -1, in amber).
// Mining has its bottom bar lit orange, Weapons its two bottom bars green and Construction all
// four cyan; the cursor rests on the third bar of Construction, which is a lighter cyan. Under
// the bars the drill, the gun turret and the factory and the captions MINING, WEAPONS and
// CONSTRUCTION. The HUD lays out on a virtual screen of 1280x720, which this window shows at half
// size: the bar spans x 103..130 and y 302..308 of the window.
include apps/oreelse/test/visual/setup/seed
include apps/oreelse/etc/oreelse

using box.surface
using oreelse

const hover = box.command.commands.mouse_move("[116, 305]", false)

window {
  Surface: {width: 640, height: 360}
}

$ {
  (OreGameState, Playing)
  OrePowerAlloc: {level: [1, 2, 4]}
}
